    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2406.01234v2</id>
    <title>Driving with Latent World Models for End-to-End Planning</title>
    <summary>We propose a unified latent world model that integrates perception, prediction, and planning for end-to-end autonomous driving, achieving SOTA on nuScenes. The architecture combines a BEV encoder with a diffusion-based action head. Code at https://example.com/repo.</summary>
