    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/cs.CV/0405001v1</id>
    <title>Diffusion Policy for Bimanual Manipulation in Cluttered Scenes</title>
    <summary>A diffusion-based action expert for bimanual manipulation with proprioceptive and visual conditioning. Trained on 50 demonstrations, the policy generalises to unseen object arrangements and outperforms ACT by 14% on success rate.</summary>
